kr(9,'0.9','m','>=','출입구(문)은 아래의 그림과 같이 그 통과유효폭을 0.9미터 이상으로 하고,','item 6(a)(1)',('6','1',None,'PDF page 3 of 22'),'entrances and doors that persons with disabilities enter','Quantity: minimum clear passage width of an entrance door. The same sentence sets the clear distance in front of the door at 1.2 m. Para (2) sets 1.2 m for sports facilities\' doors for competition wheelchair users; not filed.',W)
kr(4,'1.2','m','>=','복도의 유효폭은 1.2미터 이상으로 하되,','item 7(a)',('7','a',None,'PDF page 4 of 22'),'corridors and passages','Quantity: minimum clear width of a corridor.',W)
kr(4,'1.5','m','>=','에는 1.5미터 이상으로 할 수 있다.','item 7(a)',('7','a',None,'PDF page 4 of 22'),'corridors and passages with rooms on both sides','Quantity: width for a corridor with rooms (거실) on both sides; the text says it MAY be set at 1.5 m or more (할 수 있다), a permission, so the comparator records the stated floor only. The quote starts at a line break inside the sentence in the extracted text.',W)
kr(11,'2.1','m','>=','통로상부는 바닥면으로부터 2.1미터 이상의 유효높이를 확보해야 한다.','item 7(라)(3)',('7','라',None,'PDF page 5 of 22'),'above a passage','Quantity: minimum clear height above a passage. If an obstacle lies within that height the clause requires a barrier or protective wall at 0.6 m or below.',W)
kr(5,'1.4','m','>=','이 경우 대변기의 전면에는 휠체어가 회전할 수 있도록 1.4미터×1.4미터 이상의 활동공간을 확보하여야 한다.','item 8(나)(1)(가)',('8','나',None,'PDF page 11 of 22'),'in front of the water closet in a new-build accessible toilet','Quantity: side of the square activity space (1.4 m by 1.4 m) in front of the water closet so that a wheelchair can turn; stated for newly built toilets. For competition-wheelchair toilets the text states 1.5 m by 1.5 m; not filed.','the clause says 휠체어가 회전할 수 있도록 (so that a wheelchair can turn)',lens='MOB')
